4. **Action**: Test one predeclared volatility gate on lookback-5 momentum using existing regime-stability and null framework. Use a volatility condition that activates signals only when past volatility is below threshold, preserving the exact test configuration of momentum.py.

5. **Value**: This addresses the unresolved bottleneck of temporal robustness while testing whether volatility regime conditioning (different from MA filters) can help the momentum mechanism. Tests a fundamentally different conditioning approach to the MA filters that were previously falsified.

**EXECUTION**: Now implementing the volatility-gated momentum test.
